2026-10-01, verifier fix round, branch task/uac-r2-141-f1: BLOCKED ON AN OWNER DECISION. The schema asks Dataverse for an alternate key AND field-level security on contact.sprk_externalobjectid, and the platform allows only one (notes §9, CLAUDE.md §6 / §6.5 escalation; recommendation B2: keep FLS on the binding column, put the key on an unsecured mirror column). G-1 is stopped by a preflight in the schema script; every later gate waits with it. All other verifier findings are closed (notes §10).
