2026-10-02, third fix round, branch task/uac-r2-141-f3: NOT BLOCKED. Owner round 4 item 4 = B2 implemented (FLS stays on sprk_externalobjectid; the alternate key moves to the unsecured mirror sprk_externalobjectidkey written in the same request as every bind and create; reads unchanged) — criterion 3 met in code, platform-enforced once G-1 runs. The registration-link gap is closed: the identity-link job reconciles every environment this BFF provisions into. The remaining INFO finding is fixed. What remains are the owner-approved live gates G-1..G-8 (run by the main session after deploy) plus a NEW live decision G-1b (the dev provisioning target spaarke-demo has no dev-BFF application user), and the publish-size measurement G-9 (main session). notes §13.</status-note>
